<title>USA: Harsco sets 2-for-1 split, lifts qtrly div.</title>
<headline>Harsco sets 2-for-1 split, lifts qtrly div.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harsco Corp said it has approved a two-for-one stock split, payable on February 14, 1997 to shareholders of record on January 15.</p>
<p>The firm also said it would increase its quarterly dividend by 5.3 percent, or $0.02 a share, to $0.40 per share, before the split. The dividend's pay and record dates are the same as those for the stock split.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
